smits the asset at issue; assets merely adjacent to the plan (existing credentials, services, or stores the plan does not touch) are out of scope and must not be findings. Oracle: `grep -ni \"does not touch\\|in-plan\" src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T5c.md` returns at least one hit.\n- [ ] The prompt gains a same-round dedup rule: one finding per (surface, defect) pair; additional criteria angles on the same pair are folded into that finding's text, not emitted separately. Oracle: `grep -ni \"one finding per\" src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T5c.md` returns a hit.\n- [ ] The derived prompt index is regenerated if the build requires it and the CI prompt-drift gate passes. Oracle: `make lint && make test` green locally; the prompt-index drift check (part of the test suite) passes.\n- [ ] No routing change: src/rebar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json is byte-identical for the T5c entry. Oracle: `git diff --stat -- src/rebar/llm/plan_review/criteria_routing.json` is empty.\n\nFiles: src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T5c.md (+ regenerated prompt index if applicable).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_T5c.md","reason":"scope + dedup rubric rules"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","d195-aeb8-2400-484b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"d195-aeb8-2400-484b","parent_status_uuid":"7154727e-c98b-4dc5-ad5e-ed14b2c2ec39","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d156-7eb5-b4f0-40c3","ticket_type":"task","title":"T5c security-overlay prompt hygiene: in-plan-asset scope + same-round dedup","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5f8a9e55-9e96-466b-87c5-8301afadb88f","298d0166-5943-41aa-85e9-eabd7fa2dd88","fa1e961e-382d-429a-aaff-e2058d30aed3","95be3a15-20c1-4854-8430-91e4427e6198",